 "content": "Decided at the 2026-10-01 design review: all new or changed public API routes go under /v2. /v1 is frozen, so don't add endpoints to it or change its behavior or response shapes. Only touch /v1 if a separate decision says to (e.g. a security fix or deprecation work). This applies only to OUR public API. Third-party and internal service URLs that contain /v1 are out of scope and must not be \"migrated\" to /v2. Examples: the payments sandbox URL in tests/test_payments.py and LEDGER_URL in src/billing/invoices.py.",
 "invalidated_by": [
